{"availability":"available","full":"yeshan-jun/issn-barcode-generator","name":"issn-barcode-generator","description":"A fast browser-based ISSN barcode generator that validates ISSNs, creates 977 GTIN-13 barcodes, supports issue add-ons, and exports SVG or PNG.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-16T15:38:11Z","updated":"2026-08-16T15:38:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yeshan-jun.github.io/issn-barcode-generator/","topics":["barcode-generator","ean13","gtin13","issn","issn-barcode-generator","journal-publishing","magazine-barcode","pwa"],"demo":"https://yeshan-jun.github.io/issn-barcode-generator/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:49.028Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:49.028Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:49.028Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:49.028Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ISSN Barcode Generator is a lightweight, browser-based publishing utility for turning a standard eight-character ISSN into the EAN-13 / GTIN-13 barcode structure used for serial publications. It is designed for magazine publishers, journal teams, independent editors, designers, prepress operators, and anyone who already has an ISSN and needs a usable barcode asset for a publication layout. The project runs as a static website and is intended for deployment on GitHub Pages without a server, database, user account, or build pipeline.","The tool focuses on the complete task rather than asking the user to calculate barcode data manually. A user can enter a familiar value such as 0317-8471; the page validates the ISSN check digit, removes the ISSN check digit from the encoded base, adds the 977 serial-publication prefix, appends a two-digit publisher variant, calculates a new GTIN-13 check digit, and renders the result as an EAN-13 barcode. Optional two-digit and five-digit issue add-ons are available for workflows that use supplementary issue information."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeshan-jun/issn-barcode-generator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"79158fb83213388c0e9243649e5f1deeca8e52959bbf61dffc105a96c8c46d6d","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:49.187Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:49.187Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"ISSN Barcode Generator is a lightweight, browser-based publishing utility for turning a standard eight-character ISSN into the EAN-13 / GTIN-13 barcode structure used for serial publications. It is designed for magazine publishers, journal teams, independent editors, designers, prepress operators, and anyone who already has an ISSN and needs a usable barcode asset for a publication layout. The project runs as a static website and is intended for deployment on GitHub Pages without a server, database, user account, or build pipeline.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeshan-jun/issn-barcode-generator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"ISSN Barcode Generator is a lightweight, browser-based publishing utility for turning a standard eight-character ISSN into the EAN-13 / GTIN-13 barcode structure used for serial publications. It is designed for magazine publishers, journal teams, independent editors, designers, prepress operators, and anyone who already has an ISSN and needs a usable barcode asset for a…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeshan-jun/issn-barcode-generator/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The application does not require a user account, backend endpoint, analytics API, database, or file upload.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeshan-jun/issn-barcode-generator/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"79158fb83213388c0e9243649e5f1deeca8e52959bbf61dffc105a96c8c46d6d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeshan-jun/issn-barcode-generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:49.188Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-16T